t_excerpt":"Really delicious food. Quirky thoughtful menu, Not my favorite spot for Pho, but its not classic pho, rather its adventurous pho. We last had the chicken wings and the pork belly and the Duck pho. The chicken wings were well seasoned with crispy skins, juicy meat and crunch bits of the aromatics and herbs, The Pho managed to be both fresh and rich, and I could make a meal of the braised greens which are indescribably amazing. The boba teas with booze are really tasty. Clean, open, airy, eclecticly decorated space. Service was great, our server was thoughtful, efficient, and helpful."},{"business_id":"zWfzgYe2nT9mHYm_vl1Ukw","review_id":"t3r37rtHgehKGhA8StU-9g","date":"2019-10-01T13:17:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9476108551025391,"text_excerpt":"Holy MOPHO this was a great meal!! A friend and I came here impromptu because we were in the area, and we were so blown away by the amazing food. We got the wings, which our waiter said were renowned in the city, and they were easily the most flavorful wings I've ever had. Sweet and spicy, crispy and tender, I was in heaven! We also ordered a tofu and vegetable dish that was so packed with flavor I was blown away. We've tried to recreate that flavor in our own cooking without much luck. Lastly, we got the hot chicken bowl. That was the only thing that I found slightly disappointing, the chicken wasn't as crunchy as I would have liked and while the twist on hot Asian chicken was to do a so..."},{"business_id":"zWfzgYe2nT9mHYm_vl1Ukw","review_id":"yB_15lvC9o70rJQw1Esvcg","date":"2017-09-21T05:48:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9470382928848267,"text_excerpt":"I tried this place for the first time a week ago and came back for the second time in less than a week's time (on Wednesday). It's great. I recently tried pho on vacation and it instantly became by new favorite food. I wanted to give MoPho a shot because I saw it was a more fusion style and felt like I was ready for that. I'm glad I stopped in. Extremely flavorful food. The happy hour specials are great and I love the pork pho on Wednesday."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zWfzgYe2nT9mHYm_vl1Ukw","photo_id":"6FTAM6-3DTgNahgV79_StQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6FTAM6-3DTgNahgV79_StQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8442840576171875},{"business_id":"zWfzgYe2nT9mHYm_vl1Ukw","photo_id":"CsDchsMRBMvINCXuRoRlHw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CsDchsMRBMvINCXuRoRlHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8441982865333557},{"business_id":"zWfzgYe2nT9mHYm_vl1Ukw","photo_id":"Zoy1ZeTnv1mNxzhBk95Pog","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Zoy1ZeTnv1mNxzhBk95Pog.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.835565984249115},{"business_id":"zWfzgYe2nT9mHYm_vl1Ukw","photo_id":"w1NEwS6tGRVaMD-DAxMT-Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/w1NEwS6tGRVaMD-DAxMT-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8284409046173096},{"business_id":"zWfzgYe2nT9mHYm_vl1Ukw","photo_id":"Gi2VLXU243lyhHSRo493Hw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Gi2VLXU243lyhHSRo493Hw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7158100605010986}]},"notebook_case":null}
